      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我把花圈装饰在门边了。\n这样一来花圈整年都不会照到阳光，\n应该就不会褪色了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7384ac5aad21e3c3b433e83436612e0cca3fbb51e43b243126ec6bbfdc215247",
